{"id": "EUVD-2026-103315", "enisaUuid": "eb68f78a-b923-3a7f-9693-a6dff4bea565", "description": "phpMyFAQ 3.2.0 before 4.1.9 and 4.2.0-alpha before 4.2.0-beta contains an insecure direct object reference vulnerability in GET /admin/api/user/data/{userId}, which returns any user's full faquserdata row, including the live TOTP secret, without a SuperAdmin or protected-target check. Delegated administrators with user-management rights can read a SuperAdmin's TOTP secret and generate valid codes to bypass two-factor authentication.", "datePublished": "2026-10-17T18:46:24", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-21T21:40:10", "baseScore": 7.0, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:H/UI:N/VC:H/VI:L/VA:L/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/thorsten/phpMyFAQ/security/advisories/GHSA-hp8j-w94m-j5c7", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/phpmyfaq-3.2.0-before-4.1.9-and-4.2.0-alpha-before-4.2.0-beta-idor-leaks-totp-secret-via-admin-api-user-data"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-111905", "GHSA-44gp-7cgr-6p92"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.34, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "17cb8b26-9193-32eb-938e-a11a90be26cc", "product": {"name": "phpMyFAQ", "vendor": {"name": "thorsten"}}, "product_version": "4.2.0-alpha <4.2.0-beta"}, {"id": "53e49499-2e9e-34b2-98ab-7c727f0b3c5d", "product": {"name": "phpMyFAQ", "vendor": {"name": "thorsten"}}, "product_version": "3.2.0 <4.1.9"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "2216aa2b-6a6c-3940-a02c-e62bac2f73e1", "vendor": {"name": "thorsten"}}], "isExploited": false}